    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Chaos Cult",
    "summary": "Your DAMNED unit needs Dark Pacts to use a Desperate Pact. Offer the pact when you pick the unit to move normally, [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) or declare its charge. A unit is ineligible on the turn it comes out of Reserves. Take a Leadership test first. Failure makes the unit suffer D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) before resolving the pact. Through the rest of the phase, the unit’s models gain 2 inches of Move and the unit gets +2 on Charge rolls.",
